    <briefdescription>
<para>One homological level of the frame: the <computeroutput><ref refid="class_schreyer_frame_a2e81a03992e5beca83586384f3200cfb_1a2e81a03992e5beca83586384f3200cfb" kindref="member">FrameElement</ref></computeroutput>s living at that level plus the Schreyer order used to break ties among them. </para>
